{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"zenburn-classic","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Zenburn Classic","description":"A low contrast dark theme that is gentle on tired eyes.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Zenburn Classic","path":"themes/zenburn-classic.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/zenburn-classic.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Zenburn Classic\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#3f3f3f\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#dcdccc\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#383838\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#2b2b2b\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#2b2b2b\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#383838\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#4f4f4f\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#5f5f5f\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#4a4a4a\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#383838\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#2b2b2b\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#8cd0d3\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#8cd0d3\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#8cd0d3\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#5f5f5f\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#4f4f4f80\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#8cd0d3\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#2b2b2b\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#cc9393\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#7f9f7f\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#f0dfaf\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#cc9393\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#7f9f7f\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#cc9393\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8cd0d3\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f0dfaf\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#dfdfbf\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#efef8f\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#dca3a3\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#dcdccc\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e3ceab\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#dfaf8f\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ffcfaf\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Zenburn Classic\n\nA low contrast dark theme that is gentle on tired eyes.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Zenburn Classic** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nInspired by the Zenburn palette by Jani Nurminen.\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#3f3f3f` |\n| Text | `#dcdccc` |\n| Accent | `#8cd0d3` |\n| Keywords | `#f0dfaf` |\n| Strings | `#cc9393` |\n| Functions | `#efef8f` |\n| Types | `#dfdfbf` |\n| Comments | `#7f9f7f` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}